                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bce66c38-ebfa-319f-ad57-24f82d6128e3",
                        "entry_id": "5222bcaf-61e0-3ddb-b14c-822121756b10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a thing that has been refurbished"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "debb1d3e-fa0c-4897-8daf-3e2c78644253",
                                "sense_id": "bce66c38-ebfa-319f-ad57-24f82d6128e3",
                                "text": "Most of the trains running today are refurbs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "783b2a31-0782-414f-b392-0bb73158b6a3",
                                "sense_id": "bce66c38-ebfa-319f-ad57-24f82d6128e3",
                                "text": "I paid $75 for a refurb Horrock-Ibbotson single-tip eight-and-a-half footer which casts like a dream."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08f99a54-5496-4b8f-afdb-95af55d2e335",
                                "sense_id": "bce66c38-ebfa-319f-ad57-24f82d6128e3",
                                "text": "But what do you do if you already have equipment that you bought, on the cheap, and you don't know whether or not it is a refurb or not?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b639e04f-aff4-4688-a526-31ffee2f76e3",
                                "sense_id": "bce66c38-ebfa-319f-ad57-24f82d6128e3",
                                "text": "However, before buying a refurb, investigate how the retailer defines “refurbished.” And find out about the return policy and what warranty you’ll get.¶ The safest place to buy a refurb is from a manufaturer."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "58bdb7a0-9747-39e7-82c3-8580bb9e69d1",
